{"v":[{"a":["إِنَّآ","أَعۡطَيۡنَٰكَ","ٱلۡكَوۡثَرَ"],"t":"We have given you plenty","l":"Inna 'A`taynaka Al-Kawthara","w":[["innā","Indeed, We"],["aʿṭaynāka","We have given you"],["l-kawthara","Al-Kauthar"]]},{"a":["فَصَلِّ","لِرَبِّكَ","وَٱنۡحَرۡ"],"t":"So pray to your Lord and sacrifice","l":"Fasalli Lirabbika Wa Anhar","w":[["faṣalli","So pray"],["lirabbika","to your Lord"],["wa-in'ḥar","and sacrifice"]]},{"a":["إِنَّ","شَانِئَكَ","هُوَ","ٱلۡأَبۡتَرُ"],"t":"He who hates you is the loser","l":"Inna Shani'aka Huwa Al-'Abtaru","w":[["inna","Indeed"],["shāni-aka","your enemy "],["huwa","he (is)"],["l-abtaru","the one cut off"]]}]}